@title S2 EP 02 • THE LAKE HOUSE
@bg party_lakehouse_night
@show riley
Friday. The lake house belongs to somebody's uncle. Nobody is sure whose. Riley has the keys anyway.
Riley: House rules! No crying before midnight, no texting exes, and no—
@show nia
Nia: (walking in) —no inviting the person you specifically didn't invite? Too late.
Riley: Who let you in?
Nia: Your mom. She thinks I'm a good influence.
Riley: She thinks a lot of wrong things.
Across the deck: Nicole and Valentina, both talking to the same baseball player. Neither is smiling anymore.
@show valentina
Valentina: Marco, tell Nicole how you DM'd me first.
@show nicole
Nicole: Tell Valentina how you asked ME to this party.
> [Bold] Pull Valentina away. "Not worth it, babe." -> p1
> [Sweet] Get Nicole a drink and change the subject. -> p2
> [Bad] Record it. Maya will pay. -> p3
> [Bitchy] "Marco, pick one or go home." -> p4
*p1
@add Valentina_Friendship 2
@add Nicole_Friendship 1
Valentina: Ugh, FINE. But only because your outfit is cute and I'm not losing my lashes over a shortstop.
@jump p_done
*p2
@add Nicole_Friendship 3
@add Valentina_Friendship -1
Nicole: (exhaling) Thank you. I was about to say something I'd regret on a Monday.
Valentina watches you two walk away together. She does not forget it.
@jump p_done
*p3
@add Drama 3
@add Maya_Friendship 3
@add Nicole_Friendship -2
@add Valentina_Friendship -2
By morning, three teams have seen it. The clip has a sound on it. The sound is going viral on campus.
@jump p_done
*p4
@add Drama 1
@add Nicole_Friendship 1
@add Valentina_Friendship 1
Marco: (sweating) I mean... I kind of liked both...
Nicole and Valentina look at each other. Then at him. For the first time all year they agree on something. Marco leaves in his socks.
*p_done
@show riley
Midnight. Riley climbs onto the roof of the boathouse with a speaker.
Riley: SASHA. Get up here. View's insane.
@show nia
Nia: Riley, get down. You're drunk and that roof is rotten.
Riley: You're not my mom, Nia. You're barely my friend.
> [Bold] Climb up with Riley. -> r1
> [Good] Side with Nia. "Come down, Riley." -> r2
> [Bad] Film it. This is content. -> r3
> [Sweet] Get Riley down with a bribe: "I'll make you pancakes." -> r4
*r1
@add Riley_Friendship 3
@add Nia_Friendship -2
@add Reckless 1
The view really is insane. The roof really is rotten. A board cracks under Riley's foot and she just laughs and grabs your hand. Down below, Nia doesn't laugh.
@jump r_done
*r2
@add Nia_Friendship 3
@add Riley_Friendship -1
Riley: (climbing down, annoyed) Fine. FINE. Y'all are so boring.
Nia: (quietly, to you) Thanks. She doesn't listen to me anymore.
@jump r_done
*r3
@add Drama 2
@add Reckless 1
@add Riley_Friendship 1
@add Nia_Friendship -3
The clip gets four thousand views. Riley loves it. Coach does not.
@jump r_done
*r4
@add Riley_Friendship 2
@add Nia_Friendship 2
Riley: (sliding down the drainpipe) Chocolate chip?
Sasha: Obviously.
Nia mouths "thank you." Riley hugs you so hard you both fall in the grass.
*r_done
@bg party_lakehouse_night
At 2 a.m., somebody screams from the dock. Everybody runs. Riley's phone is in the lake. So is Brooke's car key. So is, somehow, the basketball jacket.
@show jordan
Jordan: (standing on the dock, dry, holding nothing, smiling) What? It slipped.
